{"Title":"An Act to create a facilities loan program for private special education schools","BillNumber":"S295","DocketNumber":"SD2248","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JFK0","Name":"John F. Keenan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JFK0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T20:26:52.09"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JFK0","Name":"John F. Keenan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JFK0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T20:26:52.09"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S295/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Keenan, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 295) of John F. Keenan for legislation to create a facilities loan program for private special education schools.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Massachusetts School Building Authority, under the authority granted to it under the School Modernization and Reconstruction Trust Fund pursuant to section 35BB of chapter 10 of the General Laws, shall promulgate regulations for the creation of a no-interest or low-interest loan program for facility construction and upgrades at schools approved under chapter 71B.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}